# Shadcn Form Rules

## 🔴 CRITICAL - FOCUS LOSS PREVENTION
**Check FIRST before any form code:**
- [ ] No components defined inside other components
- [ ] Using shadcn FormField with render prop
- [ ] Using {...field} spread in FormControl
- [ ] Make sure all buttons are clickable and do something. 

## ❌ INSTANT VIOLATIONS
// ❌ WRONG - Component inside component (causes focus loss)
const MyForm = () => {
  const CustomField = () => <Input />; // FOCUS LOSS!
  return <form><CustomField /></form>;
};

// ✅ CORRECT - Component outside + shadcn pattern
const MyForm = () => {
  return (
    <Form {...form}>
      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)}>
        <FormField
          control={form.control}
          name="email"
          render={({ field }) => (
            <FormItem>
              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>
              <FormControl>
                <Input {...field} />
              </FormControl>
              <FormMessage />
            </FormItem>
          )}
        />
      </form>
    </Form>
  );
};
```

